# Derived from the style of sdk/include/kamos/*.h (4 spaces, PascalCase, pointer bound to the
# name, aligned macros and declarations). The hand-written headers still differ in 86 places
# (measured with clang-format 18.1.3 --dry-run), mostly the alignment of trailing comments, so
# they are not formatted by tools/ci/format-check.sh. Owner: A02.
BasedOnStyle: LLVM
IndentWidth: 4
ColumnLimit: 100
UseTab: Never
PointerAlignment: Right
SortIncludes: Never
BreakBeforeBraces: Linux
AllowShortFunctionsOnASingleLine: None
AlignConsecutiveMacros: Consecutive
AlignConsecutiveDeclarations: Consecutive
AlignConsecutiveAssignments: Consecutive
